Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.75,0:00:19.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The newest Toei Animation film, featuring extensive shooting
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.19,0:00:24.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,at many impressive locations across Japan\N and filled with endless love for steam locomotives.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.80,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon! Good luck!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.20,0:00:32.03,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The imposing figure of D51, filmed from various angles,\N is featured prominently,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.03,0:00:34.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,with the fun of animation mixed in.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.85,0:00:39.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Witness the love and friendship \Nbetween Yaemon and the boy Tadashi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.30,0:00:45.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A spring blockbuster for all steam locomotive fans \Nand good kids across the country.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.57,0:00:49.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Great Adventure of D51: \NYaemon the Locomotive.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.46,0:00:53.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Stay tuned for {\i1}Yaemon the Locomotive{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.49,0:01:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
